eye-contact-co-processing-at-the-speed-of-light-lines-11 = cons "## 8. Phenomenology: Why It Feels Intense" (cons "" (cons "The lived intensity of sustained eye contact—intimacy, vulnerability, immediacy, and social charge—is not a cultural convention. It is the direct phenomenological correlate of high-bandwidth, low-latency, unfakeable coupling." (cons "" (cons "Opening an optical channel with minimal abstraction layers exposes internal autonomic state simultaneously in both directions. Withholding gaze reduces coupling conductance; sustaining it raises mutual information to the highest bandwidth biology supports without physical contact." (cons "" nil)))))
